{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1537766-alternative-campaign-setting-curseborne-as-post-wod-setting","id":1537766,"title":"[Alternative Campaign Setting] Curseborne as Post-WOD setting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-21T12:03:52-07:00","id":1537766,"title":"[Alternative Campaign Setting] Curseborne as Post-WOD setting","content":"By which I mean as a literal one.<br /> <br /> Imagine that the apocalypse happens with not a bang but a whimper, at least for humans. The Antediluvians eat the majority of the Elders and plenty of other groups, the Avatar Storm never really lets up, the Dark Things come from the Dreaming, the Demons run wild only to be taken down by Lucifer, and the Garou have gone off to slaughter the Wyrm in the Umbra.<br /> <br /> Assume all of this happens in 2004 or so.<br /> <br /> It's now a generation later.<br /> <br /> The idea would be using Curseborne as what happens with the supernatural rebuilding itself after a bunch of events that leave the majority of the supernaturals of the world as newly created with only a few &quot;elders&quot; leftover from the previous world and interacting in a newer, stranger society where the rules of magic have heavily changed. Strange alliances have to be made and power are very different.<br /> <br /> &quot;What you knew before is now worthless.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm debating selling a campaign of it as a way to switch over my players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-21T15:50:32-07:00","id":1537772,"title":"","content":"Well, to start, I think that is is the best and worst thing to happen to the Technocrats.<br /> <br /> Good news: Reality is stable, all magic is explicitly working outside of laws that everyone agrees on, hooray!<br /> <br /> Bad news: Reality deviance is now its own rule of physics, and within it, cannot be easily quantified beyond &quot;obeys second law of thermodynamics&quot;, hence all these weird Accursed mutants that need to perform ritual behaviors to avoid starvation, and how the least altered mutants, the Sorcerers, need to burn things of metaphysical importance lest the pressure send them into a delirious state and they lose control over their powers.<br /> <br /> The surviving members are going to be gathering up more scientific Accursed and convincing them of the paradigm, and that they are elements of an invasive alternate reality, but one that can be used to exile negative elements and study this strange alternate universe called the &quot;Outside&quot; for the good of all.<br /> <br /> In other words, they're going to double down, even as they open membership up slightly. If you can accept your powers are not magic, but an alternate form of physics, and you do your best to protect the Masses, you're in. But everything else, including that which cannot be negotiated with on the basis of <i>being a location, </i>like an idyllic little Liminal village that nobody wants to leave simply because they like it there? Burn it. Quite simply, they'll become the Global Occult Coalition from the SCP-verse.<br /> <br /> As for the Kithain, they're going to go &quot;...oh, so that's what the young Fomorians look like. Huh. Well, we can deal.&quot; Yeah, Accursed are all dark dreams of survival, hunger, fear, and ambition...but they just want to get by, same as anyone else. I can see them and a group of Dead getting along like a house on fire (and possibly setting houses on fire).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-21T15:50:39-07:00","id":1537773,"title":"","content":"If we follow the idea behind Mage's Paradigms and Demon's different layers of reality, it could be used to describe the Outside- like, the multitude of different realities have all collapsed upon themselves, creating a strange and alien place, where the world of Curseborne is the &quot;sinkhole&quot; in which the world stabilized or something along those lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}